The mass absorption coefficients inside EPQ are the FFAST tabulation (NIST Standard
Reference Database 66, Chantler et al.); their own terms were flagged as unclear by the
v5.0 research (docs/archive/v5/edx-research-2026-10-05/reports/validation.md §2) and are
carried here as a recorded risk. The element table in
`mac4DSTEM/Core/Spectroscopy/Quant/QuantElementData.swift` (atomic weights and densities)
comes from eXSpy's elements data (GPL-3.0-or-later; see the eXSpy section above).

