Third-party ground truth
================================================================================

tools/thronsen-dataset/truth/truth_stride3.json is derived from the ground-truth
phase map of Thronsen et al., "Scanning precession electron diffraction data
analysis approaches for phase mapping of precipitates in aluminium alloys",
Ultramicroscopy 255 (2024) 113861, data at Zenodo 10.5281/zenodo.6645396
(ground_truth.hspy), licensed CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changed: every third row and
column kept (tools/thronsen-dataset/make_truth.py), written as JSON. SHA-256
45600cce0e59cf8dd3325ba71da091986b0b98635988e3623702753b75ca4af4. It is not
distributed in the application bundle.
